--
[temp.variadic]/8 `sizeof...(T)` in a static data member initializer.  Fixed by
the unified pack-expansion rework (Phase 0 + Phase 4,
doc/architectural/cpp-variadic-pack-expansion-rework.md):
  * template_mapt::build no longer scalar-binds a parameter pack to its first
    argument (type_map[Pack] = <first element>), which had collapsed
    sizeof...(Pack) and pack expansions to a single element; and
  * static data member initializers are now type-checked with the C++
    type-checker whenever a pack is bound (pack_args_map/pack_size_map), so
    sizeof...(T) is evaluated from the pack size rather than mis-parsed as
    sizeof(T).
Covers a multi-element pack and an empty pack.
